  "description": "Enterprise Advanced Outlook PST and OST Recovery, Deep Forensic Analysis, and Mailbox Reconstruction Engine for .NET. Specialized in corrupted PST/OST repair, deleted email and attachment carving from unallocated slack space, zero-header recovery, and standalone Microsoft Outlook Unicode PST generation without Outlook or MAPI installed. Universally compatible across .NET Standard 2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0 - 3.1), .NET 6.0, .NET 7.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 9.0, and .NET 10.0+. High-performance independent architecture with zero external dependencies.",
