  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1 Enterprise Multi-Target Release:\n- Universal runtime support: Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0 - 3.1), .NET 6.0, .NET 7.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 9.0, and .NET 10.0+.\n- Dual Architecture compilation: Modern JIT SIMD Vectorized intrinsics for .NET 9.0/10.0 and universal fallback binary for legacy platforms.\n- Deep Slack block forensic carving with permanently deleted email and attachment recovery.\n- Standalone PST creation without Microsoft Outlook or MAPI installation requirements.\n- Enterprise-grade intellectual property protection with full string and control-flow obfuscation.",
